  "translations": [
    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "Snake，你的西班牙语是在哪儿学的？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 47,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "在<R=国防部语言学院,DLI>。你呢？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=国防部语言学院,DLI>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 44,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "我自学的。以前也就会打打招呼，直到来了哥伦比亚，才开始能应付稍微复杂点的对话。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 117,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "这样啊。好，那我问你。「guerrilla」准确是什么意思？答答看。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 84,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "意思？你是问词源吗？按西班牙语发音是「guerrilla」，意思是「小型战争」。它是表示战争的「guerra」加上指小后缀派生出来的。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 171,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "答对了。这个词本来只是普通名词，不过它开始具有特殊含义，是从什么时候起呢……来，米勒同学？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 135,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "别叫我同学了，Snake。搞得我想起自卫队的游骑兵课程。答案是<R=半岛战争,西班牙独立战争>……对吧？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=半岛战争,西班牙独立战争>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 136,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "正确。看来你没逃欧洲近代史的课。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 48,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "据说这个词的由来，是1808年爆发的半岛战争中，用来指西班牙人抵抗法兰西帝国军时采用的战术。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 130,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "不过……原来是「小型战争」。教科书里看到「Guerrilla」这个词时完全没感觉，可按它原本的语言一听，概念立刻就清楚了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 165,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "没错。游击战说到底，就是一场小规模战争。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 60,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 11,
      "cn_text": "正因如此，开战的门槛也低。也拜此所赐，我们从来不缺饭碗。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 84,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 12,
      "cn_text": "最后一道也答对了。<R=干得不错,Well done>，米勒同学。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=干得不错,Well done>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 71,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 13,
      "cn_text": "都说了别叫我同学。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 27,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 14,
      "cn_text": "……。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
